3	/**
4	 * Immutable structured audit event emitted when an owner is created, rendered as the JSON object
5	 * {@code {seq, ownerId, customerCode, membershipLevel, event:'OWNER_CREATED'}}.
6	 *
7	 * <p>{@code seq} is a monotonically increasing sequence assigned by the emitter (see
8	 * {@code RespondWithOwnerCreated}). The {@code customerCode} field carries the owner's current
9	 * <em>primary identifier</em> (see {@link OwnerIdentities#primaryIdentifier(org.springframework.samples.petclinic.model.Owner)}):
10	 * the customer code today, and whatever replaces it later (e.g. the {@code memberId}) — the value
11	 * follows the primary identifier without any change here.
12	 *
13	 * <p>The record is immutable: once constructed the event cannot be altered before or after it is
